window.products.push({"id":413207,"name":"Counter Height Bar Stools Set of 2 PU Leather Height Adjustable Swivel Bar Chairs with Back and Chrome Steel Base Kitchen Counter Stools Dining Chairs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FagxgxqvL._AC_.jpg","description":"Modern bar stools are suitable for restaurants, kitchens, living rooms, entertainment rooms, offices, cafes, etc. The barstools can swivel 360 degrees, and the height of the stools can be adjusted by the handle. The high-density thick sponge cushion provides you with a comfortable seat. The cushioned surface is made of PU leather for easy cleaning. Footrest place design makes it easy to place your feet, you can sit back and relax and enjoy long conversations. The base is made of chrome steel, which makes the stool durable.The bottom of the rubber ring prevents the floor from being scratched. ➤DIMENSIONS: Set of 2 Bar Chairs + High Duty Chrome + High-Density Sponge Cushion + 360° Swivel Function+ Height Adjusting + Back & Footrest Support Delivery Time: 3-5 Days ➤Product Features: ♥ Sponge-filled PU leather cushion gives you extra comfort ♥ Curved footrest pedal in the middle to put your feet to relax ♥ Adjustable height from 25'' to 33’’ can satisfy your different needs ♥ 360°rotating direction to swivel at will ♥ A large circular iron base provides more stability ♥ A rubber ring under the stool to protect the floor and increase the stability ♥ SGS-certified iron rod for safely using ♥ Elegant appearance be more multi-functional ♥ Widely used in bars, kitchen counters, coffee shops, or any other places ♥ Simple assembly and clean ➤Please rest assured to buy: ♥ Easy to install- The bar stools set of 2 comes with all hardware and necessary tools. ♥ Fast Delivery- All of our items are shipped from local warehouses in the US, including GA, LA, FL, etc. We ship within 1-4 days and you will receive your counter height bar stools quickly within 1 week! ♥ After-Sales Guarantee- All products in our store will enjoy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FagxgxqvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tyyps","source_asin":"B09KTNXLPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KTNXLPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KTNXLPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":413208,"name":"2017snow 90X200cm Frosted Privacy Glass Film Static with Glue Cling Window Film Green Bamboo Frosted Stained Glass Stickers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714zEI71w2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Name: window film Material:PVC film and Pet film Length:79\"/piece or...... 200cm/piece Width:35\" or........ 90cm  (when ordering multiple lengths,one continuous roll will be shipped, up to maximum of 50meters ).  Properties of products: 1. Privacy protection, light through 2. Anti-UV, reduce use air conditioning times, Low-carbon and energy convervation. 3. Easy to stick and rip, protect your window glass.  How to use 1,The film has 2-3 cm longer than glass each edges(eg:your glass size is 20*30cm,the film needs 26*36cm) 2,Clean the glass thoroughly 3,Try to spray more water on glass.Make sure the film loses stickiness to move 4,Stick a side on the glass,slowly tear the rest of the transparent paper 5,Move th film into suitable place,scrape the water and bubbles out with screper 6,Cut the excess film","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714zEI71w2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"2017snow","source_asin":"B0748CZQC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0748CZQC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0748CZQC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
