window.products.push({"id":413210,"name":"No Suction Cup Bathmat, Bath mat for refinished Bathtub, Safe for All Ages, 29x15 Inch Bath Mat, Machine Washable, Rectangular Design, Made in Italy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71csmzB1ZyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifically designed for REFINISHED or REGLAZED bath tubs. It has NO SUCTION CUPS. Makes your bathing experience safe and more enjoyable Your beautiful and sleek bathtub surface is the most overlooked killer. But our nonslip bathtub mat is here to make every bath safer and unwinding in a real sense. Made with inside out, cup free suctions, our bathtub/shower mat stays put so you can bath with complete peace of mind. WHY DID WE DECIDE TO GO SUCTION CUP FREE? Although suction cups claim to provide a \"non-slip protection,\" they are not fail-proof. A little bit of dirt or soap on the surface is enough to slide them off. Besides, suction cups will pull the paint off the bathtub ruining your finish. We designed an innovative reverse suction design that doesn't cling to harm your surface yet stays put to provide non-slip protection. When you stand or sit on our refinished bathtub mat, the reverse suction design presses on the surface, giving you a secure grip. ONE MAT, THREE FUNCTIONS: SAFETY: Pregnant women and elderly can step into the bathtub more confidently without the fear of slipping. This kids bathtub mat also keeps children who love playing in water safe and away from slipping SAFETY: Pregnant women and elderly can step into the bathtub more confidently without the fear of slipping. This kids bathtub mat also keeps children who love playing in water safe and away from slipping PROTECTION: Bathtub refinishing is an expensive investment and it is worth taking care of. Bath mats with suction cups can totally ruin the look of your bathtub. Suction cups will pull at the finish and will cause problems in the long run. Because our bathtub floor mat do not contain any suction cups, they are more gentle on your bathtub PROTECTION: Bathtub refinishing is an expensive investment and it is worth taking care of. Bath mats with suction cups can totally ruin the look of your bathtub. Suction cups will pull at the finish and will cause problems in the long run. Because our bathtub floor mat do not contain any suction cups, they are more gentle on your bathtub Relaxation: The raised circles also provides a great massaging experience so you can unwind while you showerFEATURES:Stylish neutral design: The white color of our bath mat blends in seamlessly with your bathtub and bathroom décorSuitable for all: Adults, toddlers, children, pregnant women and seniors, our no slip bathtub mat can be used by everyoneDURABLE: Unlike rubber mats, our durable vinyl Relaxation: The raised circles also provides a great massaging experience so you can unwind while you shower FEATURES: Stylish neutral design: The white color of our bath mat blends in seamlessly with your bathtub and bathroom décor Stylish neutral design: The white color of our bath mat blends in seamlessly with your bathtub and bathroom décor Suitable for all: Adults, toddlers, children, pregnant women and seniors, our no slip bathtub mat can be used by everyone Suitable for all: Adults, toddlers, children, pregnant women and seniors, our no slip bathtub mat can be used by everyone DURABLE: Unlike rubber mats, our durable vinyl DURABLE: Unlike rubber mats, our durable vinyl","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71csmzB1ZyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Non-SlipBathMats","source_asin":"B07JHV9TBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JHV9TBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JHV9TBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
