window.products.push({"id":413277,"name":"Bruno Octopus Takoyaki Plate for BOE021 Compact hot Plate Octopus Balls Japanese Best-Known Street Food Fun to Make for Friends and Family","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vYGifzaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What do you need.. BRUNO compact hot plate + Bruno Octopus Takoyaki plate How to make Takoyaki: Mix. Mix the batter up with a whisk making sure there are no floury bits. Prep. Prep all of the fillings. Cut up the octopus or other favors you like , slice the green onions and make sure you have everything at the ready: a little dish of oil, all your ingredients, some skewers to flip the balls, and a plate to serve on. Heat up the pan. Pour and fill. lots of oil the pan with a brush dipped in oil. Give the batter a whisk then pour into the individual compartments all the way up to the top. It’s not big deal if they overflow not that much. Add in the fillings and let cook until the edges start to look more solid and opaque. Flip. this is most important step, use your skewers to turn the takoyaki 90 degrees. If they don’t easily move, they need more time to crisp up. Once they’re at a 90° angle, pour in a bit more batter to ensure a super round ball. Let cook, stuffing in any excess batter that’s outside the ball, then turn again. You should have a round ball. Cook until the balls are crispy and brown, moving the balls around from mold to mold to evenly cook. As the balls crisp up, it will be easier to flip them. Sauce. When the balls are golden and crisp, pop them on a plate and brush with takoyaki sauce and squeeze on some mayo. Enjoy the Japanese famous street food Takoyki and enjoy the cook with Bruno.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vYGifzaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRUNO","source_asin":"B09JKXBTZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JKXBTZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JKXBTZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
