window.products.push({"id":413303,"name":"HuaLan Reusable Fiberglass Chopsticks Set, Dishwasher-Safe Chopstick, Non-slip Design Chop Sticks, 9 1/2 Inches 5 Pairs, Gift Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71StI0M2mEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☺Healthy Material: Our fiberglass chopsticks are made of food-grade polymer fiberglass. Unlike cheap plastic chopsticks, fiberglass chopsticks do not contain wax, BPA, formaldehyde; no paint, no coating. The method of distinguishing fiberglass chopsticks and plastic chopsticks: the real fiberglass chopsticks have a crisp sound when knocked, while low-quality plastic chopsticks have a dull sound. ☺Reusable: Bamboo chopsticks and plastic chopsticks will become moldy, cracked and easily contaminated with bacteria after long-term use. Our fiberglass chopsticks have the characteristics of high density, high temperature resistance and corrosion resistance, so they can be reused, and  prevents chopsticks from getting stained and going bad when in contact with food， bring you a healthy life! ☺Elegant and Practical Design: Our chopsticks are comfortable to hold, the chopstick body is designed with non-slip texture; the tips are engraved with dense texture for a better grip on food; square body design will avoid chopsticks from falling down from table while not using, really friendly to beginners and frequent users. suitable for families, restaurants, and travel. ☺Product Features: Our products can withstand the high temperature of 356 ℉（180℃）and can resist the corrosion of strong acids and alkalines. They can be sterilized with boiling water or sterilized in a sterilization cabinet. No melting, breaking or deformation, easy to clean, no residue, no mold. They can be washed by hand or dishwasher. ☺Functional Use: Our chopsticks are not only suitable for all kinds of Asian food such as rice, hot pot, ramen, dumplings, sushi, Korean fried chicken, Japanese sushi, General Tso's chicken, Kung Pao chicken, Vietnamese Spring rolls, salads, are also suitable for western food, like spaghetti, tonkatsu, BBQ, etc. Our chopsticks are packaged in gift boxes, which can be used as holiday gifts among families and friends, birthday gifts, company annual meeting prizes, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71StI0M2mEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HuaLan","source_asin":"B09SZ1PFP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SZ1PFP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SZ1PFP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
