window.products.push({"id":413328,"name":"Cast Iron Dutch Oven - 5-Quart Deep Pot + Lid + Pan Scraper + Handle Cover Grips - Large Pre-Seasoned Cooker for Baking Bread, Soup, Frying - Indoor/O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716I0xXmK5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE DUTCH OVEN - NOW WITH A HEAVY DUTY CAST IRON BRAISER LID – Cuisinel once again revolutionizes the culinary world by introducing the dutch oven with a braiser lid. With our meticulously placed drip-points - along with even moisture and heat distribution - you can now take your cast iron wizardry to the next level by effectively turning your pot into a casserole or braiser with perfect cooking results. Cooker and cover can withstand any temperatures without fear of shattering or cracking. PRECISION HEAT DISTRIBUTION and UNRIVALED HEAT RETENTION – Cuisinel cast iron is famous for that perfect, succulent sear, without losing any heat when cold food hits the pan. Whether you're using our premium cookware on your kitchen stove, oven, BBQ or even an inconsistent campfire, the lossless heat retention and superior heat distribution makes managing your cooking times effortless. Can be used for frying, baking, grilling, broiling, braising and sautéing meats, vegetables and more! SUPERIOR PRE-SEASONED CRAFTSMENSHIP – Crafted to last for generations, Cuisinel sources the highest quality materials in casting our cookware. Cuisinel cast iron is notoriously safer than teflon or other non-stick materials. Continuous easy-to-follow seasoning will result in a safe, healthy and virtually non-stick pot. After every use, cast iron should be hand washed, dried thoroughly on the stove at medium heat and seasoned with natural oils; Do not put in dishwasher and do not air dry. INCLUDED SILICONE HANDLE HOLDERS + PAN SCRAPER + CARE and USE GUIDE – This set comes complete with non-slip, heat-resistant handle covers providing a confident grip while cooking or serving food (always use oven mitt when handling cast iron cookware). Nifty Pan Scraper makes cleaning easy. Dishwasher safe and easy to hand-wash handle holders and scraper. Each set includes our Care and Use Guide for beginners and professional alike, so you can be confident in how to care for your new set. ERGONOMIC DUAL SIDE-HANDLE DESIGN – Designed for 2-handed use and a more confident grip, the intuitive dual handle skillet makes for a more robust and rugged cooking utensil - along with the deep pot, lends itself for casseroles, braising and baking: cakes, pies, baked mac and cheese, along with cooking and frying all your favorite classics: steaks, burgers, eggs, fish, grilled cheese and much, much more. COOKWARE TO LAST A LIFETIME AND BEYOND - Cast iron cookware notoriously improves with use, lasts a lifetime and can be passed down from generation to generation. Create a lifetime legacy of warm, fond memories with friends and family and imbue those sentiments into this superb cast iron cookware and you'll smile every time you use - and so will anyone that you gift cast iron to! USA-BASED CUSTOMER CARE - RISK-FREE MONEY-BACK GUARANTEE: As the premier cast iron cookware brand, Cuisinel cares about the quality and craftsmanship of every product we design! However, if there is any issue or any reason this item is not for you, thanks to Amazon's seamless, quick and easy 30-day money-back guarantee, this purchase is totally risk free! Step up your kitchen game with this unique must-have now and gift it at any event. CARE and USE GUIDE + LIFETIME WARRANTY: Each set includes our Care and Use Guide for beginners and professional alike, so you can be confident in how to care for your new set. So, go on, fire up your Cuisinel cookware. If anything happens, it's on us. In additional to Amazon's seamless 30-day money back guarantee, Cuisinel Cast Iron guarantees the quality and durability of all its products for a lifetime, so you can be assured that you are making the right choice and there is no risk to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716I0xXmK5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cuisinel","source_asin":"B0BVWK42L3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVWK42L3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVWK42L3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
