window.products.push({"id":413388,"name":"Pletmin Sink Caddy Instant Dry Kitchen Sink Organizer Sponge Holder for Kitchen Sink Diatomaceous Pedestal Stand Riser with Stainless Steel Feet Prote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SRhwI9VGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Drying Instantly】Unlike traditional sink caddy, our sink organizer are made of environmentally friendly and durable diatomite, which can absorb twice its weight in water in seconds, keeping your bathroom and kitchen countertops dry, while also keeping your household essentials dry. [ Original design ] The sink tray is made of high-grade absorbent material and has four screw legs. At the bottom of each spiral leg, there is a silicone pad to protect the organizer of the sink, which is waterproof and rust-proof, and also protects the sink from scratching, and can also play a role in anti-skid. It withstands the harshest humid conditions, is practical and easy to install, requires no tools, and uses our simple screw-feet to assemble your new kitchen rack in less than a minute. [ Practical and versatile ] Kitchen countertop finisher can not only be filled with cleaning bottles, dishwasher brushes and sponges, but also can be filled with soap brushes, candles and essential oils, can also be used as a small home decoration tray. The kitchen sink organizer can also absorb the moisture of wet cotton towels. Its raised base and 0.9-inch elevated design facilitate quick drying of household essentials and protect the countertop from water damage. [ Beautiful and practical ] Decorative kitchen or bathroom or bedroom of modern art. You can put it on a table, shelf or fireplace and use it to decorate an entrance, kitchen, living room or bathroom. Quick-dry bathroom sink storage box Simple and elegant circular surface design for any environment, creating a harmonious balance between form and function. [ Size and load-bearing ] The size of the kitchen sink rack is about 11 x 4.7x 1.4 inches. Our kitchen caddy rack is 0.8 inches longer and wider than the ordinary sink storage rack. The kitchen sink soap tray can carry up to 30 pounds. Kitchen sink accessories can be placed in many places without taking up too much space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SRhwI9VGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pletmin","source_asin":"B0BXW51GFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXW51GFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXW51GFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
