window.products.push({"id":413425,"name":"Thin Kitchen Rugs Set,Soft Cushioned Anti Fatigue Mats with Rubber Bottom for Floor Front of Sink,Waterproof Super Thin Leather Kitchen Floor Mat Runn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WM92Ln-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍UNIQUE DESIGN: The anti-fatigue kitchen mat is ergonomically designed, the extra thick pad provides comfortable support, helps improve blood circulation and posture, ensuring you can stand comfortably while working in the kitchen or any workstation. Perfect for home or commercial use in hair salons, restaurants, or any space where people stand for long periods of time 👍SUPER SOFT SURFACE: The surface layer of the cushion is made of soft leather, the super soft surface can bring a comfortable touch to your feet. The cushion's interlayer is foam designed for quick rebound, making it ideal for places you often stand while cooking, working or cleaning. Designed to ease foot fatigue. 👍ANTI-SLIP BOTTOM: The bottom is made of natural rubber, it stays in place and won't move and slip. For the safety of you and your family. 👍EASY TO CLEAN: Droplets of any form remain on the surface and are not absorbed by the carpet. This allows you to easily clean by simply wiping with a damp cloth. You can also vacuum the surface to remove food crumbs and debris. 👍VERSATILITY: The anti-fatigue mat provides an extra large area for standing in laundry room, kitchen, office, farmhouse,in front of sink or any other high-traffic indoor or outdoor space. Perfect gift for friends and family! 👍PURPOSE: The main idea of our kitchen mat is ultra-thin and soft, which is our new fatigue-relieving kitchen mat specially developed for summer.Golener afombra antifatiga de cocina is committed to creating a comfortable home environment for customers, if you have any needs, please let us know and we will reply within 24 hours. Customer satisfaction is our greatest pursuit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WM92Ln-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Golener","source_asin":"B09ZYD4RWD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZYD4RWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZYD4RWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
