window.products.push({"id":413478,"name":"Food Scale, Digital Kitchen Scale for Cooking, Baking 1g/0.01oz Precise Graduation Multiple Units Grams and Oz, up to 5Kg/10Lb Weight with Backlit Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q1YBKuI8S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🍎【High Precision】: The food scale with built-in four high-precision load sensors. Accurate, elegant, easy-to-use digital kitchen scale for your largest and smallest cooking projects - weighs up to 11lbs (5kg/5000 grams) with precise graduations of 0.01 oz (1 gram). 🍋【Mutiple Units Conversion】: The gram scale switches between liquid and dry ingredients as well as English and Metric. It supports 4 units（g, ml, oz, lb）wights up to 11lb (5000g) division of 1.0oz (1g). Having this scale, you don’t have to convert the weight on your phone. 🥑【EASY TARE】: So easy and helpful is the tare function that you can get your item accurately when your bowl has something in it by just touching lightly the button. With this function, you can directly get the answer without calculating. 🍅【LCD Backlit Screen】: Even in the darkness, blue backlit screen can help you see clearly digit on the scale. Large LCD display will automatically SHUT OFF after 2 min if not in use. From now on you don't have to worry about turning the scale off and wasting the life of the batteries. 🥚【Easy to Wash】: 3mm tempered glass surface makes the platform waterproof. While measuring flour, it is so easy to spill on the scale. The sleek and glass top is very easy to wipe clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q1YBKuI8S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VersionTECH.","source_asin":"B094JQX63N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094JQX63N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094JQX63N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
