window.products.push({"id":413536,"name":"Browne Foodservice 6-Gauge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71naXNfUR6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This aluminum saute pan is part of the Thermalloy cookware line. Aluminum is typically less expensive than other cookware materials. Offers great heat conductivity. Designed with a satin finish and anti-corrosion properties, this sauté pan is an excellent choice for both restaurant and home use. Perfect for browning meats and vegetables while maintaining food moisture, texture and flavor. This pan is securely fastened with leak-proof rivets an oversized handle that allows for a comfortable and firm grip. Ready for long-term kitchen use. This sauté pan is NSF approved. Metal thickness is 6-gauge. It has 5-quart capacity. Pan measures 12-inch diameter by 2-1/2-inch height.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71naXNfUR6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisipro","source_asin":"B002CGRX3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002CGRX3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002CGRX3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":413537,"name":"FHE Group Tissue Rug Bath Mat, 45 by 27 Inches, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jgmB1vLDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The soft texture of the tissue rug pampers your feet after a bath or shower View larger The underside of the tissue rug shows the quality weaving that holds it all together and provides long-lasting durability View larger The FHE Group's inspiring and enticing tissue rug will bring a fresh new look to your bathroom floors and beyond. Luxuriant and Long-Lasting Handcrafted in India and made from recycled blended cotton, FHE’s tissue rug offers a full, plush texture that you'll find incredibly soft and comfortable to step on. And even though it has a charming, delicate appearance, the high-quality tissue rug can handle daily foot traffic with the utmost resiliency. Flexible and Fun The tissue rug works well not only as a comfy bath mat on cold, hard bathroom floors but also as a distinctive accent rug in bedrooms, family rooms, and front entrances. Or bring color and cushioning to areas where you do a lot of standing, like kitchens and laundry rooms. The fun and fluffy appearance also makes the tissue rug a perfect fit in any child’s room or a college dorm room. Fits Your Décor This versatile rug comes in two sizes — 30 inches by 20 inches and 45 inches by 27 inches — and a large selection of neutral-to-bright colors. No Fuss, No Muss Upkeep is simple and easy: Toss the tissue rug in the washer for cleaning, put it in the tumble dryer to fluff it up, and the rug will look new again--no dry cleaning or special service required. The rug's name comes from its resemblance to delicate tissue paper, but you'll find it easily handles daily wear with no-fuss care View larger Distinctive Design The FHE Group's mission is to create fresh, contemporary home accents with superior value and quality. The tissue bath rug embodies this ethos with its stunning appearance and texture that adds a \"wow\" factor wherever you use it without sacrificing durability and reliability. The tissue rug will bring delight to your eyes and your feet every day. Key Features Made from incredibly soft but highly durable cotton Made from incredibly soft but highly durable cotton Two sizes: 30 inches by 20 inches and 45 inches by 27 inches Two sizes: 30 inches by 20 inches and 45 inches by 27 inches Easy care--just toss in the washer to clean, then dry and fluff in the dryer Easy care--just toss in the washer to clean, then dry and fluff in the dryer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jgmB1vLDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fresh Home Elements","source_asin":"B00FWS7XOQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FWS7XOQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FWS7XOQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":413538,"name":"16x22 Decorative Throw Pillow Insert, Down and Feathers Fill, 100% Cotton Cover 233 Thread Count, Rectangle Pillow Insert - Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BuNw7eXGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL: Expertly filled with 95% feather, 5% down, covered with a top quality, 233 thread count fabric. made of 100% Cotton, with downproof stitching, to prevent feathers from poking out. MADE IN THE USA: Every product in the ComfyDown catalog, is proudly made right here in the United States. Thank you for supporting American manufacturing! You will love the difference! HOW TO MEASURE: Pull tight along the outer seams of your sham, then measure the middle of your sham, from seam to seam - height and width - to find the correct insert needed. RECOMMENDATION: For best results, your pillow insert should be larger than your sham to correctly fill the corners of the pillow cover, this will provide a very attractive firm and fluffy look to your sham, we recommend to place our inserts in shams that are 1\" or 2\" smaller than the pillow, It would depend on the thickness of the sham, a thick fabric would need a 2\" larger insert to keep it fluffed, a more lighter fabric would need a 1\" lager insert. USAGE AND CARE: For indoor use, with all types of shams & covers, before first use, and as needed, fluff up your pillow a few times, to get it a full plump look, this will help it last for years!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BuNw7eXGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ComfyDown","source_asin":"B0150IDR3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0150IDR3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0150IDR3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
