window.products.push({"id":413646,"name":"HCB Trash Can Automatic Garbage Can Plastic Touch Free Waste Bins 13 Gallon/50 Liter with Lid for Kitchen, Office, Living Room, Bathroom（Black）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wPrq7US2L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Life is messy! That's why we develop sensor technologies that offer quicker, cleaner access to our trashcans. Motion Sensor garbage can makes hands-free disposal of your garbage a breeze. With the wave of a hand, an intelligent sensor opens the dual-wing lid for easy access. Its touch switch design holds the lid open when required. WHY CHOOSING US? ✔ Hands-free operation streamlines waste management, so your home stays clean with less effort, will automatically close the lid within a few seconds after the trash is thrown in. ✔ Removable bag retainer ring keeps full, heavy trash bag firmly in place ✔ A simple touch switch keeps the lid open when needed ✔ Easy to clean-The barrel made of PP material makes this trash bin more convenient to clean, you can just remove the lid, rinse the bucket with water, use a rag or you can use a brush directly. ✔ Lid gently and quietly descends by soft close feature ✔ Shipped from the US, the delivery time usually between 3-7 days, you don’t need to wait for a long time to receive your package. SPECIFICATIONS ▶Name: Automatic Kitchen Trash Can ▶Material: PP material ▶Over Size: 9.8” x 15.3” x 23.6” ▶Capacity: 13 Gallon / 50 Liter ▶Battery: AA Batteries *4 (Which is not include) ▶Applicable Place: Kitchen / Living Room / Bedroom / Bathroom / Office / etc... OUR SERVICES ❤ Customers’ satisfaction is our first goal. We are committed to provide our customers with the best pre-sales and after-sales services. If you have any questions during the purchase or use process, please feel free to contact our customer service, we will try our best to provide you professional and kind assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wPrq7US2L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MGHH","source_asin":"B092D9LJMT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092D9LJMT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092D9LJMT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":413647,"name":"Veracco Thirty AF Thirty Squad 30 Years Old Stadium Party Cup 30th Party Favors Decoration Funny Birthday Gag Gifts For Him Her Thirty And Fabulous (B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510ORDFMAtL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"These cups are more than just ordinary drinkware. They are the life of the party, making every sip memorable. Crafted with care, our cups are designed to impress with their vibrant and eye-catching prints. Whether you're hosting a birthday bash, wedding reception, or corporate event, these cups are the perfect addition to elevate the festive atmosphere. Top-Rack Dishwasher Safe: We understand the importance of easy cleanup after a thrilling event. That's why our cups are top-rack dishwasher safe. Simply place them in your dishwasher, and they'll come out sparkling clean and ready for your next gathering. However, to ensure the longevity of the vibrant imprint, we recommend hand washing the cups. Hand washing not only preserves the design but also helps prevent any potential chipping or peeling, ensuring your cups stay in pristine condition for years to come. Unforgettable Party Favors: Looking for the ideal party favors to surprise your guests? Look no further! Our cups make for exceptional gifts that will leave a lasting impression. With their stylish prints and practicality, they are a perfect blend of form and function. Your guests will be delighted to take home these cups as a token of the memorable celebration. Long-Lasting Imprint: We take pride in delivering products that stand the test of time. While our cups are designed to withstand regular use, we recommend hand washing them to preserve the vibrant imprint. This extra care ensures that the design remains intact and prevents any potential weakening of the print. Enjoy the longevity of our cups and cherish the memories associated with each sip. Upgrade your party experience with our Perfect Party Favors Cups. Add a splash of color, convenience, and long-lasting imprint to your festivities. Whether it's a small gathering or a grand celebration, these cups are sure to make a lasting impression. Order yours today and let the party begin!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510ORDFMAtL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veracco","source_asin":"B08H5VHMTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5VHMTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H5VHMTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
