window.products.push({"id":413678,"name":"Magnetic Curtain Tiebacks, Curtain Tiebacks for Drapes, European Style Convenient Drape Tie Backs, Decorative Drape Tie Backs Holdback Holder for Wind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ySwstG8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO USE: Magnetic Curtain Tiebacks are fixed by magnetic at the head of the tiebacks, staying in place without falling down. Holding your curtain back in seconds, the magnets are strong enough to keep holding the curtain. Take them down is as easy, just need to open the magnetic buckle gently and they can be tied on anywhere of curtain when not in use. UPGRADE MAGNET: The strong and durable magnet with nickel plating which is smooth and anti-rust will not separate easily, perfect for protecting your draperies, easy use and store. No tying, roping through, poking holes into the walls or damage your walls, just clip on the curtain when you don't use them, decorative and easy to find. MODERN DESIGN: The Curtain Holdbacks with Unique Wooden Balls design, highlighting the low-key luxury temperament. It can be perfectly matched whether it is a simple European style or a light luxury style curtain, every exquisite curtain should be equipped with exquisite drapery tiebacks. WIDELY USE: This magnetic holdbacks can be flexibly used in multiple occasion.They are appropriate no matter heavy or light drape, blackout curtains, print curtains, wide patio door, sliding door curtains and sheer curtains. According to your preferences, you can choose a variety of ways to use. Simple design ideal for your sitting room, living room ,bathroom, bedroom, nursery etc. ADJUST LENGTH FREELY: Curtain tiebacks, total length 17.7 inch, ball's diameter is 1.25 inch. Could be twisted to adjust the length to meet your need, so no need to worry about the size is too big. Made of strong rare earth magnet, high polyester wire and plastic, which anti-crease and durable to daily life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ySwstG8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"voolwin","source_asin":"B08LCR6SSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LCR6SSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LCR6SSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
