window.products.push({"id":413806,"name":"FUOAYOC Handheld Vacuum Cordless, Powerful Suction Car Hand Held Vacuum Cleaner with Large-Capacity Battery, Hand Vacuum Cordless Rechargeable for Pet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HPpILNA4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ Cordless and Portable Design: Weighing only 2.4 lb, this Car handheld cordless vacuum allows you to move freely when cleaning furniture, stairs, kitchens, cars and more without cable. With a quiet frequency lower than 75db, you can enjoy a peaceful cleaning experience by use this portable handheld vacuum. The dual openings and \"One Button Dust Removal\" design make this dust buster easy to empty. The 450ml large capacity dust box clean the whole car or room. ✔ Upgraded Suction and LED Configuration: Equipped with an upgraded motor, this handheld vacuum cleaner has a powerful suction of 5500Pa, to handle various kinds of dirt such as small messes, kitty litter, dog food, hair, gravel and crumbs from food. The bright LED light for easy cleaning in dark areas. It's super convenient when trying to clean your car at night. ✔ Multi-Functional Attachments: The portable vacuum cleaner is equipped with slit flat tools and brush tools to meet different cleaning needs. The filter can effectively filter dust and fine particles to avoid secondary pollution. This dust busters cordless rechargeable is lightweight and ergonomically designed to fit comfortably in your hand. It can be used in rooms, corridors, cars, etc (Note: Clean the filter every 30 days to prevent suction loss and blockage and maintain good suction) ✔ Fast and Safe Charging: Handheld vacuum cordless using the latest fast charging technology and the latest generation of rechargeable batteries. This small handheld vacuuming cleaner can be fully charged within 3 hours, and can work continuously for 30 minutes. Provide temperature/short circuit/overvoltage/overcurrent/overcharge protection to ensure equipment safety. Wall mounted Charging Stand is both aesthetically pleasing and space saving, while also storing your remaining accessories. ☏ Great Gift and After-sales Service: This hand vacuum cordless rechargeable looks both modern and fashionable and it is a great gift for family or friends with pets or cars. The hand-held vacuum cleaner provides 12 months of maintenance and professional lifelong support. Just feel free to contact us if you have any problem about the handheld vacuum cordless cleaner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HPpILNA4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUOAYOC","source_asin":"B0C68L9TL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C68L9TL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C68L9TL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
