window.products.push({"id":413953,"name":"Neck Cervical Pillow for Stiff Neck Pain Relief,Height-Adjustable Lumbar Neck Support Pillow Traction Device with Heat and Magnetic Therapy,Alignment ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719kEAz8jZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"In today's busy work rhythm,we often keep working in the same posture day after day,which is the culprit that causes us to have cervical/lumbar problems.Our cervical/lumbar spine grew abnormal physiological curvature increasingly.Then we started to have a series of health problems such as neck back pain,headaches,insomnia and dizziness.Papillon cervical pillow is designed to prevent and solve above problems,combining heat compress,traction,and magnetic therapy function. Function & Principle: 1.Physical Traction and Stretch Cervical/lumbar spine has its normal healthy physiological curvature.Long-term incorrect posture causes its curvature to change.This spine support pillow with ergonomic curvature can provide correct traction and stretch for cervical/lumbar spine. 2.Adjustable Height/Hardness Air Cushion Neck pillow uses relatively soft sponge and skin-friendly fabric.Meantime,we added an air cushion inside lumbar pillow that can adjust hardness and height to ensure cervical pillow can support neck cervical or lumbar spine. 3.Hot Compress Therapy Prolonged incorrect posture will cause problems with blood circulation.Hot pack is an effective method to promote blood circulation,it can make muscle pain relief such as neck pain,back pain,etc.6 selectable temperatures meet people with different sensitivity to heat. 4.Magnetic Therapy Magnetic fields can produce microthermal effects to improve microcirculation and cell metabolism for body. 5.Intelligent Time Control 3 timing control options:15, 30, and 45 mins ensure that you avoid unnecessary trouble with forgetting to turn off the neck pillow,and being burnt at low temperature due to overuse.Just use this cervical pillow confidently. Information of Cervical Pillow: Size:16.1 x 6.2 x 2.7 inch Input:100-240V AC,50/60HzOutput:5V⎓1.5A PackageIncludes: 1x Cervical pillow,1x Wall charger,1x User guide","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719kEAz8jZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Papillon","source_asin":"B085Y33WZ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-413953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085Y33WZ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085Y33WZ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
